                                                "example_id": "2cc5de28-f71a-4ef1-ad9f-f18aaa1fa4af",
                                                "sense_id": "e015c8d4-1839-3731-b6ba-798062fa9526",
                                                "text": "BENEDICK. I have almost matter enough in me for such an embassage; and so I commit you—\nCLAUDIO. To the tuition of God: from my house, if I had it,—\nDON PEDRO. The sixth of July: your loving friend, Benedick.\nBENEDICK. Nay, mock not, mock not."
